  "title": "Vegan Green Bean, Tomato, and Basil Sheet Pan Dinner",
  "description": "Toss together this quick and easy vegan sheet pan dinner of roasted baby potatoes, green beans, chickpeas, and tomatoes seasoned with basil.",
